    "HDR" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HDR"
          }
        }
      },
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "HDR video (10-bit HEVC, HLG) with AAC sound at %lld fps. Your HDR clips keep their bright highlights; photos and captions stay at normal brightness. Keep the screen on until it finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Machine translation draft; review in context before release.\nMachine translation draft; review in context before release.\nMachine translation draft; review in context before release.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "فيديو HDR (10 بت HEVC، HLG) مع صوت AAC بسرعة %1$lld إطار في الثانية. تحتفظ مقاطع HDR الخاصة بك بأضواءها الساطعة؛ تظل الصور والتعليقات التوضيحية في درجة سطوع عادية. استمر في تشغيل الشاشة حتى تنتهي."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "HDR ভিডিও (10-বিট HEVC, HLG) %1$lld fps এ AAC সাউন্ড সহ। আপনার HDR ক্লিপগুলি তাদের উজ্জ্বল হাইলাইট রাখে; ফটো এবং ক্যাপশন স্বাভাবিক উজ্জ্বলতায় থাকে। এটি শেষ না হওয়া পর্যন্ত স্ক্রিনটি চালু রাখুন।"
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Vídeo HDR (HEVC de 10 bits, HLG) amb so AAC a %1$lld fps. Els vostres clips HDR mantenen els seus aspectes més brillants; les fotos i els subtítols es mantenen amb la brillantor normal. Manteniu la pantalla encesa fins que acabi."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "HDR video (10bitový HEVC, HLG) se zvukem AAC při %1$lld sn./s. Vaše HDR klipy si zachovají jasné zvýraznění; fotografie a titulky zůstanou v normálním jasu. Nechte obrazovku zapnutou, dokud neskončí."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "HDR-video (10-bit HEVC, HLG) med AAC-lyd ved %1$lld fps. Dine HDR-klip bevarer deres klare højdepunkter; billeder og billedtekster forbliver ved normal lysstyrke. Hold skærmen tændt, indtil den er færdig."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "HDR-Video (10-Bit HEVC, HLG) mit AAC-Ton bei %1$lld fps. Ihre HDR-Clips behalten ihre hellen Highlights; Fotos und Bildunterschriften bleiben bei normaler Helligkeit. Lassen Sie den Bildschirm eingeschaltet, bis der Vorgang abgeschlossen ist."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Βίντεο HDR (10-bit HEVC, HLG) με ήχο AAC στα %1$lld fps. Τα κλιπ HDR διατηρούν τα φωτεινά τους σημεία. Οι φωτογραφίες και οι λεζάντες παραμένουν σε κανονική φωτεινότητα. Κρατήστε την οθόνη ανοιχτή μέχρι να τελειώσει."
          }
        },
        "en-AU" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HDR video (10-bit HEVC, HLG) with AAC sound at %lld fps. Your HDR clips keep their bright highlights; photos and captions stay at normal brightness. Keep the screen on until it finishes."
          }
        },
        "en-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HDR video (10-bit HEVC, HLG) with AAC sound at %lld fps. Your HDR clips keep their bright highlights; photos and captions stay at normal brightness. Keep the screen on until it finishes."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
