            "value" : "Open Text and tap Add caption to write on your collage. Pick from %lld lettering styles, bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, all caps or stacked vertical letters, any colour, and a shadow, label, plate, outline, neon glow, sticker edge or gradient letters."
